    "text": "wymt.com\nwebsite\nHazard\nCommunity turns out for annual WYMT blood drive\nBy Caroline Mueller,\n3 hours agoHAZARD, Ky. (WYMT) - As many Kentuckians prepare for fireworks and family gatherings, a group of donors took time Wednesday to focus on something else, saving lives. The Kentucky Blood Center and WYMT hosted a mobile blood drive outside the WYMT studio in Hazard, aiming to collect donations before what experts call “trauma season.”\n1",
